{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GLASS x CANNON is a risky top down shooter roguelike. You are always very low health so you'll have to dodge and use blood to survive, collecting items and getting stronger to defeat a powers, crossing into our world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room you have one hit to survive, but clearing room restores you. Some items give you more hits survive, but you are always risking and have to be focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you'll collect Srystals, you can use them to unlock new items, special items, etc. Playing with additional challenges will give you more Srystals, so it's a great reason to check your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To beat final boss you'll have to go through more difficult alternative path, collecting The hummer and breaking Mirror with it, collecting a Heart of Deadless that will allow you to survive Sapphire Flame's last attack</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886370?t=1755120585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886370/5bf1cb942918488161ad2a2286f3f2e79b72d873/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755120585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886370/b0b489af4ecd7d0db9d01db11503b913313c6a49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755120585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886370/b0b489af4ecd7d0db9d01db11503b913313c6a49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755120585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3945800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GLASS x CANNON is a risky top down shooter roguelike. You are always very low health so you'll have to dodge and use blood to survive, collecting items and getting stronger to def